{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年7月26日 12:52 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>警方今日（26日）宣布，就大埔宏福苑火災而設立的警方熱線電話，已全部停止運作。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>警方於大火後設立傷者查詢熱線1878 999，供懷疑親友在火警中失蹤的市民查詢。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕宏福苑大火 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T05:18:20.877837+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none"}}